Intune, Entra, Graph, Azure Automation, Log Analytics

00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:28.850
एक agent बनाम multi-agent, head-to-head, parliament बनाम team

00:00:28.850 --> 00:00:31.230
और एक मात रतात मेरा subscription credit है

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:34.070
